scn 1
# Island, ground: one selection of 150 ground bodies rounds a rock (lanes2 base: t90 5873). Over 64 units: the client's 64-per-tick uplink makes three commands ticks (the test ordered all 150 in one tick).
# A formation of 150 ground bodies goes round a 24x24 rock (x 88-111, z 58-81) in open ground, from x~30 to (172,70).
# Source: legion-lanes2 lanes case 'island' (the parked lanes2 patches' laneRun), base column. Metrics: the
# 'abreast' strip is gate abreast (8 columns round x=100, the observer's segment form; the test counted x 95-105),
# 'crossings' are gate lane's (end windows at x 69-70 and 130-131).
name island-1x150
ticks 12000
probe lanes
seed 7
players 2
team 0 0
team 1 1
map flat 200 140
wall 88 58 24 24
type u mover 2 2500 10 1.79999
group U 0 u 150 cells 30,48 33,48 36,48 39,48 42,48 45,48 48,48 51,48 54,48 57,48 30,51 33,51 36,51 39,51 42,51 45,51 48,51 51,51 54,51 57,51 30,54 33,54 36,54 39,54 42,54 45,54 48,54 51,54 54,54 57,54 30,57 33,57 36,57 39,57 42,57 45,57 48,57 51,57 54,57 57,57 30,60 33,60 36,60 39,60 42,60 45,60 48,60 51,60 54,60 57,60 30,63 33,63 36,63 39,63 42,63 45,63 48,63 51,63 54,63 57,63 30,66 33,66 36,66 39,66 42,66 45,66 48,66 51,66 54,66 57,66 30,69 33,69 36,69 39,69 42,69 45,69 48,69 51,69 54,69 57,69 30,72 33,72 36,72 39,72 42,72 45,72 48,72 51,72 54,72 57,72 30,75 33,75 36,75 39,75 42,75 45,75 48,75 51,75 54,75 57,75 30,78 33,78 36,78 39,78 42,78 45,78 48,78 51,78 54,78 57,78 30,81 33,81 36,81 39,81 42,81 45,81 48,81 51,81 54,81 57,81 30,84 33,84 36,84 39,84 42,84 45,84 48,84 51,84 54,84 57,84 30,87 33,87 36,87 39,87 42,87 45,87 48,87 51,87 54,87 57,87 30,90 33,90 36,90 39,90 42,90 45,90 48,90 51,90 54,90 57,90
at 1 move U 172 70
gate lane 69 39 131 101
gate abreast 100 20 100 120
line far 150 0 150 140
region goal 160 50 190 90
# Audit definitions (lanes2 laneRun): abreast = distinct z/2 files over the strip x 95-105 (gate.strip.files_x100); crossings = lane-order
# swaps between the first entries of x=70 and x=130 within 300 ticks, >= 2 cells at both (lane.cross.swaps / .pairs).
gate strip 95 0 106 140 lateral=z
lane cross 70 0 70 140 130 0 130 140 window=300 mincells=2
